# Shared test wallets for EVERY example (preview / preprod only — the local
# devnet uses its pre-funded genesis seeds and never reads this file).
#
# You normally do not edit this by hand. Run
#
#   yarn wallets preview      # or: yarn wallets preprod
#
# to generate three fresh wallets into `.env` (gitignored) and print their
# addresses to fund at the faucet. A test suite that finds a slot empty
# generates it the same way on first run.
#
# Each network has three slots. Examples map their roles onto them: Alice = 1,
# Bob = 2, Charlie = 3 (private-party's sponsored guest Dave uses an extra slot 4,
# which is generated on demand and funded by Alice).
#
# Per slot, set ONE of _SEED (64 hex chars) or _MNEMONIC (24 words), plus an
# optional _BIRTHDAY:
#
#   _BIRTHDAY is the chain height the wallet was created at. With it, the wallet
#   fast-syncs from the reference bundle in packages/wallet/preseed (seconds
#   instead of ~78 minutes on preprod). Without it, the wallet takes a full sync
#   from genesis. Only set it for a wallet that truly had no activity before that
#   height — a wrong birthday skips the wallet's own history and hides its funds.
#   Generated wallets record it automatically. See packages/wallet/FAST-SYNC.md.
#
# Shell environment variables override values in this file.

# --- preview (faucet: https://midnight-tmnight-preview.nethermind.dev/) ---
MIDNIGHT_PREVIEW_WALLET_1_SEED=
MIDNIGHT_PREVIEW_WALLET_1_BIRTHDAY=
MIDNIGHT_PREVIEW_WALLET_2_SEED=
MIDNIGHT_PREVIEW_WALLET_2_BIRTHDAY=
MIDNIGHT_PREVIEW_WALLET_3_SEED=
MIDNIGHT_PREVIEW_WALLET_3_BIRTHDAY=

# --- preprod (faucet: https://midnight-tmnight-preprod.nethermind.dev/) ---
MIDNIGHT_PREPROD_WALLET_1_SEED=
MIDNIGHT_PREPROD_WALLET_1_BIRTHDAY=
MIDNIGHT_PREPROD_WALLET_2_SEED=
MIDNIGHT_PREPROD_WALLET_2_BIRTHDAY=
MIDNIGHT_PREPROD_WALLET_3_SEED=
MIDNIGHT_PREPROD_WALLET_3_BIRTHDAY=

# Optional: a proof server other than http://127.0.0.1:6300 for remote runs.
# MIDNIGHT_PROOF_SERVER=
